    "notes": [
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "CCNL T091 — AIOP RSA. Conglobated. 12 levels: A-B-C-D1-D2-D3-E1-E2-E3-F-G-H. Divisor 165, 13 months. Original 2012 contract, updated by accordo ponte Oct 2023."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Accordo ponte (Oct 2023) expired June 2024. Contract applied in ultrattività pending renewal. Oct 2023 table modeled as current (valid_until null)."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "Seniority: contract uses a flat EUR 40/month bonus at 5 years of service (levels A-E3 only; F/G/H excluded). Modeled as cadence_months=60, maximum_count=1. The Oct 2023 'premio di anzianita' (EUR 40 for 10+ year workers) is a one-time payment and is out_of_scope."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "Apprenticeship: contract specifies sotto-inquadramento up to 2 levels below destination (levels A-F eligible, 36 months). Engine schema requires a static pay_level_code; modeled as 100% passthrough."
      }
    ]
  },
